                                "sense_id": "0af47bd3-6dd9-3dad-a150-9e5ebd65cd8d",
                                "text": "Life and life and life! agrope in\nThe dusk of death, warm hands, stretched out\nFor swords, proved more life still to hope in."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "60e45934-9e36-4c4d-9ebe-6cb93693d839",
                                "sense_id": "0af47bd3-6dd9-3dad-a150-9e5ebd65cd8d",
                                "text": "And he saw other things too in her manner: saw how it had adjusted itself to the hidden intricacies of a situation in which, even after Mrs. Fisher's elucidating flashes, he still felt himself agrope."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
